# ===== Secrets: never commit =====
# Wi-Fi SSIDs and passwords (copy src/app_secrets.example.h and fill it in)
src/app_secrets.h
# Generic credential files, in case one is ever dropped into this folder. The droras
# server's Firestore service-account key (jdl-main-key.json) is the likeliest candidate.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*-key.json
*service-account*.json
*credentials*.json

# ===== Device images =====
# Dumps read back from a device contain its NVS partition, i.e. stored Wi-Fi credentials
# once the device has been used. The 16MB factory backup lives here too.
firmware_backup/
*.bin
*.elf
*.map
*.uf2

# ===== Build output and downloaded dependencies =====
.pio/
build/
# Fetched by the ESP-IDF component manager (versions are pinned in dependencies.lock)
managed_components/
# Generated from sdkconfig.defaults on each configure
sdkconfig
sdkconfig.old
sdkconfig.tab5
sdkconfig.*.old

# ===== Local tool state =====
# gstack browse daemon: holds session tokens and browsing logs
.gstack/
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# ===== OS and language noise =====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
